  "title": "2-axis thumb joystick on a Nano",
  "summary": "Move the X and Y sliders or click the thumbstick cap. The Nano reads VRX on A0, VRY on A1 and SW on D2 (INPUT_PULLUP), prints X, Y and the button over Serial, and lights LED L when pressed.",
